같은 집들도 많이 준비해뒀습니다!\n\n이 집, 놓치면 후회할 거예요!  여러분의 새 보금자리가 될 이 집, 함께 보러 가볼까요? 🏃‍♂️💨\n\n문자문의나 예약문의 주세여^^\n비트공인중개사사무소\n[phone removed]","addr":"서울시 마포구 백범로 24","jibun":"서울시 마포구 노고산동 129","lat":37.552771,"lng":126.936908,"imgs":["https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/3acd7c36-b01e-47a3-9318-8b63025f730c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/00c2abfd-22eb-4986-b6ac-ddc62832cd8c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/192ae7f4-435b-4200-8d70-adfa25306eda","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c68c32e1-fe85-41c3-a868-1405121aa0aa","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/62521175-1a29-4053-af60-7ccdb43d38b3","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/407783e6-0ff7-499c-b789-7536568bf021","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/d2c81f80-920f-4681-9f64-fd75cd2e79f2","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/392ccc15-db31-4921-a7f1-35821f100912","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c7668a27-14ad-4f5e-ac67-edc5e20d0f63","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/c350bbff-5b74-414c-bdc7-10c791510aeb","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/487a05aa-e528-4af4-9ec5-a92734c48f4c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/e5c9e178-faa0-4ee4-b701-40ea8dde5f65","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/cca2f406-d0cb-46d1-9c95-e56539797377","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/7401335b-11b0-4bb8-8455-eb7907fb803c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/0565ebae-81e5-4593-8a1c-205dd750194b"],"facts":[["Exclusive size","49.6 m²"],["Supply size","79.22 m²"],["Rooms",2],["Bathrooms",1],["Floor","23층 of 23층"],["Facing","남"],["Layout","복합식"],["Parking","가능, 0.74 per unit"],["Move in","즉시 입주"],["Maintenance","확인불가"],["Approved","2025.05.22"],["Households",299],["Posted","2026.10.15"]],"opts":["천장형","옷장","식탁","신발장","냉장고","세탁기","건조기","샤워부스","비데","싱크대","인덕션","전자레인지","붙박이장","화재경보기","테라스","무인택배함"],"tags":["주차","풀옵션","보안/안전"],"near":[["창천중학교","315 m"],["서울창천초등학교병설유치원","318 m"],["서울창천초등학교","350 m"],["광성중학교","429 m"]],"link":["Dabang","https:/